        "text": "2 * ((r + y*e*dP) - ((1-e)*r + y*e*dv))^2 - (((1-e)*r + y*e*dv) - 2) * (y*e*dJ)^2 = e^2 * normalizedConeGap r ((1-e)*r + y*e*dv) y dP dv dJ, with normalizedConeGap r v y dP dv dJ := 2*(r + y*(dP - dv))^2 - (v - 2)*(y*dJ)^2 (ActivationCone.lean:312)"
